    "prompt": "Create a new rare-grade persistent loot marker as exactly four distinct animation frames in one horizontal strip. Use saturated luminous golden yellow with a white-hot vertical core, brilliant yellow-gold solar/compass rays, sparkling motes, and a bright floor-contact burst. Match the gothic early-2000s Diablo-like painted 2D game VFX style and the scale/layout of the current four-frame atlas. Make every frame radiant, dazzling, and visibly brighter than the existing muted pillar, with coherent flicker between frames. Preserve equal cells, generous gutters, aligned floor-contact points, and a clearly different silhouette from the violet effect that will move to epic. No text, labels, borders, scenery, items, characters, logos, watermark, clipping, or overlap.",
